<title>FRANCE: Adidas takes Publicis for worldcup.</title>
<headline>Adidas takes Publicis for worldcup.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sportswear group Adidas said it had selected Publicis for its world public relations campaign for the 1998 World Soccer Championships, of which Adidas is a main sponsor. It gave no financial details.</p>
</text>
